{
  "id": "prologue",
  "title": "序幕（一）：搬来太阳市的前一天",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "p001",
      "title": "奶奶家门前",
      "time": "下午、傍晚前",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "background",
          "name": "bg_grandmother_house_dusk",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bgm",
          "name": "bgm_homecoming_warm",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "男高",
          "asset": "char_male_high_normal",
          "position": "center",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "携带行李、站立",
          "expression": "紧张、期待"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "男高拎着行李箱和行李袋，站在奶奶家门前。\n背景为两层老房子、门前桂花树和褪色门板。\n镜头从房屋和桂花树缓慢推进到男高。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inner",
          "speaker": "男高",
          "text": "六年了……终于回来了。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inner",
          "speaker": "男高",
          "text": "这次不是只回来住几天。\n以后，换我陪奶奶了。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "name": "sfx_door_knock",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "男高伸手敲门。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jump",
          "target": "p002"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "sourceFile": "source/story/prologue-v2/prologue.md",
        "line": 116
      },
      "background": "bg_grandmother_house_dusk",
      "bgm": "bgm_homecoming_warm"
    },
    {
      "id": "p002",
      "title": "奶奶家·进门",
      "time": "下午",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "background",
          "name": "bg_grandmother_house_entrance",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bgm",
          "name": "bgm_homecoming_warm",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "奶奶",
          "asset": "char_grandmother_warm",
          "position": "door",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "手持抹布、站在门内",
          "expression": "惊喜、眼眶泛红"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "门内很快传来拖鞋声。\n奶奶一只手里还攥着抹布，开门看见他，先笑了起来，目光却在他脸上停了好一会儿。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "奶奶",
          "text": "可算到了。路上累不累？先让我看看。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "男高",
          "update": true,
          "expression": "放松、微笑"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "男高",
          "text": "奶奶，我回来了。\n您怎么还跟以前一样，第一句话就问我累不累？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "奶奶仰头打量男高，伸手替他理了理被行李带压歪的衣领。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "奶奶",
          "text": "不问你，还能问谁？\n快进来，饭马上就好。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "奶奶让开门口，男高拎着行李进屋。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hide",
          "actor": "男高"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hide",
          "actor": "奶奶"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jump",
          "target": "p003"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
